      "writtenOn": "2021-01-14T10:57:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you prefer to move the BpfCoordinatorTest as a privileged test?\n\nReason for using TestBpfMap: \nFor bpf (api 31) testing, the test can\u0027t mock the iteration of BpfMap.forEach and no permission to access bpf map (not a privileged test).\n\nforEach() calls #{getFirstKey, getNextKey} to iterate all entries in the map. api 31 - tetherOffloadGetStats(https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/1537233/3/Tethering/apishim/31/com/android/networkstack/tethering/apishim/api31/BpfCoordinatorShimImpl.java#87) uses BpfMap.forEach which calls the consumer several times to update its entry list and then return the list to BpfCoordinator. So I need a test map which mocks forEach with a internal map if I can\u0027t access a bpf map.",
